  "changes": [
    "Read detached ArrayBuffer/view/Blob sources directly rather than converting binary data to Base64/Blob URLs and fetching it back. Preserve exact view boundaries and snapshot ArrayBuffers.",
    "Inspect primary resolver results without materializing and discarding a URL or Base64 string; retain fallback lookup behavior for model resources.",
    "Preserve detached raw/gzip/text encoding, default legacy missing encoding to raw, remove only the data-file reference and terminate header assembly before its blank separator.",
    "Normalize LF/CRLF headers and append a harmless final comment so Three NRRDLoader does not truncate the final metadata field. Preserve every payload byte.",
    "Normalize multi-byte binary endian after the shared decoder, without modifying caller input; textual samples do not undergo binary byte swapping.",
    "Require three scalar dimensions, reject nonzero line/byte skips and reject binary data whose decoded voxel count differs from declared dimensions.",
    "Race detached resolver, Blob, fetch and body reads against cancellation. Observe late errors, release late responses and preserve borrowed string URL ownership."
